# The yard (game/corridor.h, on the corridor's right half): the run's moves (game/walker.h), each
# met at a full run. Booted on foot (BOOT_ON_FOOT 1) on the left half at out 1300: strafe left
# onto the yard's half, then hold Up: a run by the rail (1600: vault over it, landing beyond), the
# duct (1900: slide under it, the eye low), and after a run-up the ledge (2450: climb it, 90 up).
# Shots every 0.2 s. Film it: tests\e2e\run_e2e.ps1 -Steps yard.steps
wait_up
shot yd_00_stood
hold l 2.8
shot yd_01_on_the_yard_half
keydown up
wait 0.2
shot yd_02
wait 0.2
shot yd_03
wait 0.2
